  "actionable_findings": [],
  "review_checks": [
    "Both fixed and scene graphs finish with the resource initial states declared for the next frame. Compute tint releases to COMMON, the graphics consumer waits for its fence, and frame reuse waits for both submission fences.",
    "PassWork uses the compiled PassId mapping. Graphics query slots are packed after the compute pair and use the appropriate queue timestamp frequency.",
    "DepthRead is read-only and available on the graphics queue. D3D12 maps it to DEPTH_READ with pixel/nonpixel shader resource states, matching deferred depth sampling.",
    "Configuration exact-field checks precede iterator dereferences. JsonValue numeric extraction rejects nonfinite values. Source digest, vector shape, camera basis, FOV, clipping and exposure constraints are validated transactionally.",
    "DrawConstants is 192 bytes and FrameConstants is 160 bytes. Static assertions check sizes and offsets. Each record starts on a 256-byte boundary, and the owning frame upload is written after retirement waits.",
    "The geometry root signature binds draw b0 and frame b1. Lighting and tone mapping bind frame b1, with texture slots matching the shader declarations.",
    "The HDR target is RGBA16_FLOAT. Lighting emits linear HDR, and a separate ToneMap shader writes the existing SDR target before copy/present.",
    "Resize flushes both queues before replacing depth, color, GBuffer and HDR targets. Frame constants are regenerated using the new viewport dimensions.",
    "Shader build registration and exact package allowlist both include ToneMap.ps.cso. Source and public header registration include the three foundation modules."
  ],
